{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","id":"bfa37324-c3bd-4e89-9389-8ece32d054cf","timestamp":"2026-11-16T05:28:40.655Z","version":"2.1.311","querySource":"repl_main_thread:outputStyle:Concise","shapeHash":"9803daf85cbe48be5f6ca225f95dc13bf2e5a024e85e5325762dd209c1ad3e02","params":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"1f51f1ef-1603-4005-aaf0-1a57b8ccd91f","keep":1041,"tail":["a3abd7afd5df56d35dc50321dc54835acdd4acbad9f8f337309a46f085bebd93","f441d2e0b3412b06cd81ef3c3bbeed95dff093a9dc7f75e1c6bc1b8522050e6b","9e672f737c8f0cb9ef2d69d7b889f682a5168366108db95c1e4e82ba37be477e"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1043,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"a344741e1c6363fffcd3060f0804ece1332ce4da9cdc0581752be8dc61e1329e"}
{"parentUuid":"086dbfde-14cf-48ee-8635-1a6a274b22a8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch649xKi2uRJuvAr3PkAK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Change 278's finding is fixed, and the conflicts on #480 and #483 are gone.\n\n**278 (#480) finding.** `add_absent` dropped `other.discriminant_prop`, so a factory whose render callback takes `Props = A | B` ended up with `discriminantProp: null`, and TOON left the discriminator out. It now keeps it when self has none, as `merge_parent` does.\n- **Test:** `a_render_callbacks_discriminated_union_keeps_its_discriminant` fails without the fix and passes with it. I checked by reverting the fix. Core lib tests pass (1074).\n- **Pushed** as df5a1503 and the finding is resolved.\n\n**Conflicts.** I merged `main` into both branches. Main already contained the scheduler and the other merges. #483's merge passed the whole workspace nextest run, 1629 tests with none failing, and was pushed as ac03d894. #480 and #483 now show BLOCKED (awaiting approval) instead of DIRTY.\n\n**Open findings: none** on 278 or 281. The only other open PR is #487, which is a chore I haven't touched.\n\n**What remains for you:** approve and merge #480 (change 278) and #483 (change 281), in that order. The earlier Entire Gates failure on #481 is moot now that it's merged."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":485,"cache_read_input_tokens":634861,"output_tokens":435,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":485,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":435,"cache_read_input_tokens":634861,"cache_creation_input_tokens":485,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":485},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"33b331e0-797b-4834-b973-684c18d8b488","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch649wzMz37KUhwyijhZD","requestRef":"bfa37324-c3bd-4e89-9389-8ece32d054cf","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5c71199c-2abe-495f-8988-9b1b920fc62d","timestamp":"2026-11-16T05:28:44.310Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","session_id":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/caliper/.claude/worktrees/agent-abdd35c983e9e5db8","sessionId":"ad4b3461-bb6f-49f0-bb4d-997d9b8887ba","version":"2.1.311","gitBranch":"mf5-483","slug":"hazy-conjuring-volcano"}
