{"parentUuid":"e4d0d646-c5e6-4fc7-9960-c07bf04be276","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch65gzqjxZEYjceCVu8zm","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GAkKCHkvLaD9fNWcDD6rHg","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"278: factory callback parameter defaults","subagent_type":"general-purpose","model":"sonnet","isolation":"worktree","prompt":"Fix one finding on change 278 (PR 480, branch `feat/factory-own-props`, trail 405). `git fetch origin` (if fetch is blocked, use the existing origin refs); start from `origin/feat/factory-own-props`; local branch `fix/factory-callback-defaults`; commit locally; I push. Read /Users/gabe/Projects/caliper-fixtures/worker-contract.md, then `entire trail finding show 01M7HD8WV0X0 --branch feat/factory-own-props --repo gh/orin-dx/caliper --project gh/orin-dx` and crates/core/src/extractor/factory_props.rs (~55-59) plus how normal function components get defaults (`extract_param_defaults` in crates/core/src/extractor/). The finding: for a factory returning `React.FC<{ id?: string }>` a render callback such as `({ size = 'M' }: { size?: 'S' | 'M' }) => <div />` now contributes `size`, but its default value is absent: the factory path captures only the annotation and never calls `extract_param_defaults`. Fix: collect the callback's destructuring defaults with the same function normal components use and attach them to the callback's props (same representation `ComponentMapping::param_defaults` uses), so the output prop has its `defaultValue`. Tests first (fail on base): the finding's example gives size defaultValue `'M'`; a callback with no default gives none; an unannotated callback with defaults still follows the allow-list (only proven render callbacks contribute); defaults with a nested destructure/rename/computed key do not panic and are skipped rather than guessed. No generator, no red-team. Gates (targeted): `pnpm install --offline --ignore-scripts --frozen-lockfile` in the worktree first; `just lint doc-check machete typos`; nextest `-p caliper-docgen-core`. Then run `/code-review low` once and AWAIT its output; fix only real bugs. Own CARGO_TARGET_DIR under /Users/gabe/Projects/caliper-fixtures/shrink/, rust 1.99.1 first on PATH (/Users/gabe/.rustup/toolchains/1.99.1-aarch64-apple-darwin/bin). Cap 40 tool calls. Final message at most 40 words: branch, SHA, exit codes."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1153,"cache_read_input_tokens":637287,"output_tokens":2517,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":340},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1153,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2517,"cache_read_input_tokens":637287,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1153,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1153},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01GAkKCHkvLaD9fNWcDD6rHg":{"description":"278: factory callback parameter defaults","subagent_type":"general-purpose","model":"sonnet","isolation":"worktree","prompt":"Fix one finding on change 278 (PR 480, branch `feat/factory-own-props`, trail 405). `git fetch origin` (if fetch is blocked, use the existing origin refs); start from `origin/feat/factory-own-props`; local branch `fix/factory-callback-defaults`; commit locally; I push. Read /Users/gabe/Projects/caliper-fixtures/worker-contract.md, then `entire trail finding show 01M7HD8WV0X0 --branch feat/factory-own-props --repo gh/orin-dx/caliper --project gh/orin-dx` and crates/core/src/extractor/factory_props.rs (~55-59) plus how normal function components get defaults (`extract_