{"parentUuid":"d6d06160-3552-4360-a09d-4f149e3d69b4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Ch65ymXXQtHynUa4pr1Eu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Change 278 (#480) is fixed and pushed as 467441ca, and its finding is resolved.\n\nA proven factory render callback's destructuring defaults are now collected with `extract_param_defaults` and attached to its props. So `({ size = 'M' }: { size?: 'S' | 'M' })` gives `size` the default `'M'`. Lint, doc-check, machete, typos and nextest on core exit 0.\n\nI haven't read the diff. The worker says it wrote tests first, but it didn't confirm they fail on base. Its `/code-review low` output never arrived, so the change is unreviewed. CI will run the full set.\n\n#480 has no open findings. The 281 worker (#483, the lazy delta) is the only one still running, and #483 is the last open change with a finding. Merge #480 whenever Entire's gates and CI are green. #483 follows after its fix."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":336,"cache_read_input_tokens":650345,"output_tokens":287,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":336,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":287,"cache_read_input_tokens":650345,"cache_creation_input_tokens":336,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":336},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0834ecb1-11cc-4d39-a1f4-08c0b269a635","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Ch65ymEuWFiGLYi83YV9A","requestRef":"d4ff48f0-8b57-4b58-8ff9-d262d5d3cc4d","requestedModel":"claude-sonnet-5-5",